  "content": "\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/banner.png\" alt=\"Epic Fight banner\"></center>\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"divider\"></center>\n\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/bePatron?u=53051224\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/shared/icons/patreon.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/NbAJwj8RHg\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/shared/icons/discord.png\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@yesman4100\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/shared/icons/youtube.png\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/Antikythera-Studios/epicfight\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/shared/icons/github.png\" alt=\"GitHub\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/shared/icons/curseforge.png\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" /></a>\n</center>\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"divider\"></center>\n\n## Epic Fight\n\n<center><em>Epic Fight 為你的遊玩體驗增添了深度的遊戲機制與戰鬥風格。融合了一絲魂系戰鬥元素與顛覆 Minecraft 傳統框架的獨特動畫處理，Epic Fight 將把你的遊戲體驗提升至全新層次，並在探索途中帶來絕佳的新挑戰。</em></center>\n\n**全新機制：** 你將面對改版後的 Minecraft 戰鬥系統，所有實體都具備全新且富有挑戰性的戰鬥機制。Epic Fight 徹底翻新了遊戲體驗，將源自知名作品的魂系戰鬥帶入其中，例如 FromSoftware 的《黑暗靈魂》系列、《隻狼：暗影雙死》與《艾爾登法環》。\n\n**難度設定：** Epic Fight 初看可能令人望而生畏，尤其是從未體驗過魂系戰鬥挑戰的玩家。然而，本模組是為所有玩家設計的。我們確保提供了豐富的武器與技能選擇，讓每位玩家都能找到適合自己的遊玩風格。\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"divider\"></center>\n\n## ✨ 功能特色\n\n- **魂系戰鬥** - 探索一個擁有全新實體行為、挑戰與可製作物品的世界！\n- **技能系統** - 尋找、學習並精通酷炫的新能力，解鎖對抗敵人的全新戰鬥方式！\n- **新武器** - 打造性能卓越的各種新武器，搭配不同的技能與遊玩風格！\n- **高度自訂** - Epic Fight 提供極致的設定彈性，試試各種配置選項，將其調整至你最滿意的狀態！\n- **多人共遊** - 可以獨自享受此模組，也能與好友組隊，共同組成冒險小隊並探索世界！\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"divider\"></center>\n\n## 📷 遊戲截圖\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/ZZZZZZZZZ1.png\" alt=\"media\"></center>\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/1827189298.png\" alt=\"media\"></center>\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/207981072389172389.png\" alt=\"media\"></center>\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"divider\"></center>\n\n## 📥 安裝方式\n\n**客戶端與伺服器皆需安裝！**\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"divider\"></center>\n\n## ⚙️ 設定選項\n\n大部分選項均可在遊戲內直接更改，無需重新啟動。請開啟 **Mods → Epic Fight → Config**，或直接編輯位於 `.minecraft/config/epicfight-common.toml` 的設定檔。\n\n> **小提示：** 對設定檔所做的修改將在下次載入世界時生效。\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"divider\"></center>\n\n## ❤️ 致謝\n\n由 **Antikythera Studios** 精心製作。\n\n- **程式碼與美術** - Antikythera Studios 團隊\n- **翻譯工作** - blade_master_x, nameed, smokingbastard, luke_nogami, xablauler, a_k1m0, requiem4, shape.nan, ig114514, andy852546, kevinl2000, icewolf8964, yesman_0, kilotheneko, banikula, majmun.boy 以及眾多其他協作者。\n\n喜歡這個模組嗎？在專案倉庫留一顆 ⭐，或在 Modrinth / CurseForge 上推薦本模組，將對我們有莫大的幫助！\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"divider\"></center>\n\n<center><a href=\"https://billing.sparkedhost.com/aff.php?aff=2724\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/epic-fight/assets/support.png\" alt=\"Support & Affiliates\"></a></center>",
